     "Firewall ni igikoresho cyangwa porogaramu isuzuma ibinyura mu muyoboro ikabyemera cyangwa ikabihagarika ukurikije amategeko. Iba hagati y'umuyoboro wizewe, nko mu biro, na interineti.",
     "Routeur, imiyoboro y'ibigo na mudasobwa akenshi bifite firewall. Ikomeze ikore, wemere gusa serivisi ukeneye, kandi usubiremo amategeko igihe hari ikihindutse.",
